      "title": "70% of active survey respondents reported the Discourse Context feature as core to their workflow; 57% reported the Node Menu as core.",
      "content": "70% of active survey respondents reported the Discourse Context feature as core to their workflow; 57% reported the Node Menu as core.\n\nUsage survey (N=41) feature adoption data.",
