      "content": "PhD student LZ used the extension to map a 'logic line' of questions, claims, and evidence for a paper introduction, enabling him to write a compelling contribution narrative.\n\nVignette from interview and field notes.",
      "created": "2026-11-10T15:29:09.642Z",
