        "x:_schema_Evidence",
        "Evidence"
      ],
      "title": "Cell biologist MA extended the discourse grammar with HYP, RES, CON, ISS nodes to structure primary research, enabling modular documentation of hypotheses, experiments, results, and quarterly student…",
      "content": "Cell biologist MA extended the discourse grammar with HYP, RES, CON, ISS nodes to structure primary research, enabling modular documentation of hypotheses, experiments, results, and quarterly student rotations.\n\nVignette from lab deployment and data exports.",
      "created": "2026-11-10T15:29:09.642Z",
