      ],
      "title": "MA and a PhD student conducted a 3-hour synthesis session using Playground canvas to cluster result nodes into compound figures, revealing gaps and duplications in the student's mental model.",
      "content": "MA and a PhD student conducted a 3-hour synthesis session using Playground canvas to cluster result nodes into compound figures, revealing gaps and duplications in the student's mental model.\n\nCollaborative synthesis vignette from Discord message.",
      "created": "2026-11-10T15:29:09.642Z",
