        "Evidence"
      ],
      "title": "40% of survey respondents reported the grammar editor as core to their workflow; users created extensive custom node types (HYP, RES, CON, ISS, TRM, DSV opportunity/constraint/solution nodes).",
      "content": "40% of survey respondents reported the grammar editor as core to their workflow; users created extensive custom node types (HYP, RES, CON, ISS, TRM, DSV opportunity/constraint/solution nodes).\n\nGrammar personalization evidence from survey and field observations.",
