      "@type": [
        "x:_schema_Protocol",
        "Protocol"
      ],
      "title": "Discourse Context component: associative trail navigation between notes based on discourse relations (inform/support/oppose), bidirectional traversal without manual dual specification.",
      "content": "Discourse Context component: associative trail navigation between notes based on discourse relations (inform/support/oppose), bidirectional traversal without manual dual specification.\n\nNavigation interface for discourse graph exploration.",
