      ],
      "title": "Synthesis Query component: specialized queries over discourse graph elements and relations (e.g., find evidence informing a question but opposing a claim; display methodological attributes).",
      "content": "Synthesis Query component: specialized queries over discourse graph elements and relations (e.g., find evidence informing a question but opposing a claim; display methodological attributes).\n\nQuery interface for synthesis work.",
